usage: slopmop logs list [selectors] [--params] [output flags]
list log entries (no selector = every type, no --node = every node)

selectors (single dash, pick any; none = all):
  -auth       authentication log
  -firewall   firewall log
  -kernel     kernel ring buffer
  -sysmon     Sysmon events
  -task       task / job log

params (double dash, take a value):
  --node      <node>|all
  --since     <time>

output flags:
  -o wide|json    every column, or JSON
  -q              column 1 only, one per line
  --no-headers    no header row
  --tz local|utc  zone of displayed times (default utc)
